      "text": {
        "en": "Dog guardians widely commend founders Peter and Sophia alongside their staff for patient, non-judgmental guidance and gentle supervision. Two critical reviewers reported boarding disputes concerning dog behavioral fit and medical attention, yet most clients describe the team as deeply caring and trustworthy."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 20,
      "title": {
        "en": "Comforting environment for anxious dogs"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners report that shy pups, small breeds, and dogs coping with separation anxiety thrive in the calm daycare setting. Reviewers appreciate careful size separation during group play and note that pets return home happily exhausted and relaxed after their boarding and daycare stays."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Frequent digital photos and activity logs"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients emphasize the detailed daily reporting provided through the digital booking portal, which tracks walks, meals, bathroom breaks, and mood updates alongside video clips. Pet parents value these regular updates for delivering continuous peace of mind while away from Toronto."
      }
    }
  ],
